185
00:10:55,960 --> 00:10:59,800
Can take half of the whole liquidity from the DEX without the token.

186
00:10:59,800 --> 00:11:02,760
So token holders are an important part of it.

187
00:11:02,760 --> 00:11:05,560
And token holders are basically going to be interested in

188
00:11:05,560 --> 00:11:09,000
how much reward can I have for holding the token.

189
00:11:09,000 --> 00:11:12,440
And they need to be there to optimize the DEX,

190
00:11:12,440 --> 00:11:15,640
ensure that the value is flowing to the right liquidity providers.

191
00:11:15,640 --> 00:11:22,680
So basically, by aligning the incentives between these three groups of traders,

192
00:11:22,680 --> 00:11:25,160
liquidity providers, and token holders,

193
00:11:25,160 --> 00:11:29,560
you end up with an economic model that is very, very powerful.

194
00:11:29,560 --> 00:11:32,280
One of the big differences is if you go back,

195
00:11:32,280 --> 00:11:35,080
and we call this the DEX trial on the Uniswap,

