197
00:11:37,640 --> 00:11:40,360
It solved it between two parties.

198
00:11:40,360 --> 00:11:44,200
It solved it between traders and liquidity providers.

199
00:11:44,200 --> 00:11:48,600
But it was a bit capped because it was only exchanging fees and liquidity

200
00:11:48,600 --> 00:11:50,360
between these two parties.

201
00:11:50,360 --> 00:11:53,000
Curve was the next big innovation in the sense of

202
00:11:53,000 --> 00:11:56,840
