204
00:11:59,880 --> 00:12:04,040
And there's a lot of other reasons tokens are useful in this context, too.

205
00:12:04,040 --> 00:12:07,560
But we're going to send only half of the fees to the token

206
00:12:07,560 --> 00:12:09,480
and half to liquidity providers.

207
00:12:09,480 --> 00:12:13,080
So in our model, basically, the big breakthrough is

208
00:12:13,080 --> 00:12:17,400
that you want to give 100% of the revenue to the token

209
00:12:17,400 --> 00:12:20,680
and give the token basically to liquidity providers.

210
00:12:20,680 --> 00:12:23,960
And that is the ultimate state of this DEX troubling.

